      "writtenOn": "2024-04-04T13:01:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Anyone using this is probably a broken mess anyway and this has been around forever, but this has always been a bug. This class has always had something that assumed `fOffset` was always an offset into the `fData`. It seems Skia no longer uses it, as it was replaced with `SkRBuffer::skipToAlign4`. This should probably be removed as it generally doesn\u0027t make sense (and doesn\u0027t appear to be used anywhere in Chromium).",
      "revId": "251b09c65f0b78ccd846d51ec0296b39f4c7177e",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
