      "message": "Need a language that supports declaring pre and post conditions and invariants in a sane way. But yeah, if someone wanted to `SkASSERT(fOffset \u003c\u003d fData-\u003esize())` at the beginning and end of every method on `SkMemoryStream` that would be fine.",
